This drama is based on history but has creative twists

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:17.610
Episode 1

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:26.370
Project coordinator and song translator: Nemie

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:36.470
Translators: Nemie, Kaia

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:46.570
Beta Editor: Sana

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:56.670
Typesetters: Nemie, Kaia, Sana

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:39.750
Ahjusshi

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:45.950
Have you ever wanted to fall asleep for hundreds, even thousands of years?

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:51.100
Everything keeps going wrong

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:53.910
and there is no hope for improvement

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:58.150
You tell yourself: "I'm sure everything will work out"

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:00.650
And then something else happens

00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:06.400
How nice it would be

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:11.970
fall asleep and never wake up

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:20.420
I want to forget everything

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:24.180
But I can't

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:31.420
This idiot left me with a ton of debt

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:36.460
This slutty girl tricked me and ran away with him

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:38.540
Damn

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:43.450
No one should be trusted

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:49.460
Do you know this, ahjusshi?

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:52.750
I thought if my feelings don't change,

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:56.720
then the feelings of the people I trust and love will not change either

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:01.400
I was wrong

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:11.720
How could my life end like this?

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:18.660
Life cannot be changed by your own will

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:23.370
Unless you die and come back to life again

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:25.560
What?

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.720
No

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:17.840
Ahjusshi!

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:21.310
No

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:26.800
No, no. I'm sure someone saw it

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:31.350
By the time I get there, someone else will already save him.

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:35.390
Ha Jin, you don't have to. No need

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:38.280
Even if not you, then someone else...

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:41.440
God! Why me again?

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:50.740
Eun Yul!

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:52.660
Dear, this is our Eun Yul!

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:55.070
Eun Yul, Eun Yul!

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.910
Eun Yul, wait!

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:00.170
Eun Yul!

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:15.220
- Grab your hand
- Yes

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:22.880
Grab your hand

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.260
How could you do this to me?

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.240
Are you crazy?

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:48.570
Goryeo, Songak (Kaseong)

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:24.140
It's the Wolf! Wolf!

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:01.890
Wolf!

00:08:01.570 --> 00:08:04.670
4th Prince Wang So

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:18.800
- Faster!
- Okay, I'm going

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:22.570
10th Prince Wang Eun

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:25.720
14th Prince Wang Jong

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.620
Jeong!

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:36.100
Brother

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:40.840
3rd Prince Wang Yeo

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:46.470
13th Prince Baek Ah

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:00.520
8th Prince Wang Wook

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:07.670
9th Prince Wang Won

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:09.740
Brother, look

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:11.340
Do you see these muscles?

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:13.250
Jeong, I'll go

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.330
Brother, wait for me

00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:17.410
Brother

00:09:28.590 --> 00:09:29.790
Brother

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:35.440
Is our 4th brother not here yet?

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:38.960
He must bathe if he wants to take part in the ritual

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:42.010
Did he ever do as we wanted?

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:44.690
Don't bother him. It will be worse for you

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:47.210
Don't you know our Uka?

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:49.800
He always worries about others

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:53.640
Who else will take care of him?

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:55.780
At least I should do this

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:58.400
Will this be his first time taking part in the ritual?

00:09:58.400 --> 00:10:02.020
I think His Majesty has good reason for calling him

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:06.780
Use steam and make sure all wrinkles are removed

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.300
Back A

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:18.910
Did you hear that our 4th brother killed a family in Shinzhu?

00:10:18.910 --> 00:10:22.500
They said he was very cruel. Like a wolf tormenting people

00:10:23.800 --> 00:10:25.880
You can't believe all these rumors

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:29.570
In our country, what all sorts of bandits can’t come up with?

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:34.140
Our guests from Shinzhu said this. It must be true

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:35.990
It's just a rumor

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:37.660
How can he remove the local government himself?

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:39.100
What about the local army?

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:41.980
Even excellent fighting skills are not enough here

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:44.860
By the way, So never even had a master who taught him martial arts

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:48.940
Jeong, you and So have the same mother

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:51.360
You can't know when you too will turn into a wolf

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:55.770
Shut your mouths

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:02.690
That is, if I came from the same womb,

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:04.620
Am I not human?

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:10.320
My brother has very rude jokes

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:12.780
I'll talk to him later. Don't take it to heart

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:17.420
4th Prince Wang So will return to Shinzhu after the ritual is completed

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:21.880
If some stupid rumors reach the emperor, I will not sit idly by.

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:24.310
Got it?

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:31.380
Brothers, let's bet who can swim the longest?

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.520
Let's go to the outdoor pool

00:11:34.910 --> 00:11:38.180
Eun, that's enough. Stop already

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:43.580
Brother if you give me one chance I can silence him

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:44.930
Everything is fine

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:48.490
Brothers! Let's hurry up

00:11:49.610 --> 00:11:52.000
Jeong, come quickly

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:18.720
What kind of place is this?

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.420
I'm a survivor

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:24.110
What a relief! Unreal!

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:36.460
Hey! You... You!

00:12:36.890 --> 00:12:39.500
What are you doing here?

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:41.070
Why is there a girl here?

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:44.840
Brothers, brothers!

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:49.200
Brothers, brothers, brothers!

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:54.030
Madam, madam

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:55.650
- Me?
- What is this?

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:57.030
Brother!

00:12:58.510 --> 00:12:59.870
It's a girl!

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:02.030
It's a girl! Young woman!

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:03.320
- Madam!
- Young woman!

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:05.280
Is there anyone?

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:08.810
Hey, stop!

00:13:08.810 --> 00:13:10.330
Stand!

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:14.230
Dare you spy on the princes?

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:22.490
Hae Soo?

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:25.540
What to do? We're in trouble

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:29.520
Madam, hurry up. We're in trouble

00:13:32.340 --> 00:13:34.500
Now is not the time for this

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:35.840
Faster

00:13:36.760 --> 00:13:39.520
What are we doing?

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:41.690
Faster. Lord...

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:47.530
You haven't been out for a long time. I realized that something was wrong

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:50.730
The princes started swimming and I couldn't even go looking for you

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:53.360
Crazy. Hurry up. Let's go

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:59.230
Are you feeling better already?

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:05.470
Madam. Princes?

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:08.770
Strange. How did I end up here?

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:11.700
- Let's go
- Wait

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:15.630
I...

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:19.030
Do you know me?

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:20.110
What?

00:14:20.110 --> 00:14:22.240
Doesn't look like a park

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:24.110
What am I doing here?

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:26.940
Madam!

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:32.610
How come you don't know what you're doing here?

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:35.560
This is the largest bath in Songak

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:54.980
What is this? I guess I died

00:14:54.980 --> 00:14:57.960
So this is what it is -

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:00.910
afterlife?

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:02.410
Madam!

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:07.070
Goryeo Palace

00:15:21.470 --> 00:15:23.050
- Open the gate!
- Open the gate!

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:34.090
I will leave a servant with you, prince

00:15:34.650 --> 00:15:38.710
When the ritual is over, do not delay your return to Shinzhu

00:15:39.380 --> 00:15:42.960
You were adopted by the Kang family, don't forget it

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:47.570
Don't discredit our name in front of the Emperor

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:50.370
Adopted?

00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:56.540
And I thought I was your hostage all this time

00:16:56.580 --> 00:17:00.270
The sword cannot be used inside the palace

00:17:05.490 --> 00:17:09.430
Should I get my horse ready for your return?

00:17:13.270 --> 00:17:14.730
I won't be back

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:45.270
I won't be back

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:50.040
I will not allow myself to be a hostage in Shinzhu

00:18:32.080 --> 00:18:33.300
Hae Soo

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:39.910
You've finally woken up!

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:48.820
Does it still hurt?

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:52.810
Am I hurt badly?

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:53.990
And don't say

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:57.440
You fell like that! I thought your head was going to explode

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:59.740
Do you know how worried the lady was about you?

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:04.630
- Hae Soo
- By the way

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:09.190
Why do you keep calling me Hae Soo?

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:11.500
My name is Go Ha Jin

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:15.760
What?

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:18.930
Why do you call me "Hae Soo" or "Mistress"?

00:19:18.930 --> 00:19:21.180
I don't understand why you call me that

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:28.050
Oh, exactly. I died

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:33.070
You are not dead. Didn't die

00:19:33.070 --> 00:19:34.360
Am I not dead?

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.480
It wasn't a dream

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:35.420
If I'm not dead

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:38.370
where am I?

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:41.870
Su!

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:45.650
Su!

00:20:51.470 --> 00:20:53.610
Bring a doctor

00:20:53.610 --> 00:20:54.640
Yes

00:20:55.530 --> 00:20:56.940
What kind of place is this?

00:20:56.940 --> 00:21:00.400
No, no... I... Who am I?

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:04.340
Don't you remember anything?

00:21:04.340 --> 00:21:06.400
Your name is Hae Soo

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:07.680
Hae Soo

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:10.680
I'm your sixth cousin, Myung Hee

00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:12.470
Hae Soo?

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:14.460
Am I Hae Soo?

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:18.500
Am I really in another person's body?

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:30.240
Think carefully. Take a good look at me

00:21:31.070 --> 00:21:33.300
Are you in Songak now?

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:37.650
This is the home of the 8th Prince Wang Wook

00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:40.620
Songak, then?

00:21:42.580 --> 00:21:44.020
Is this Goryeo then?

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:49.920
Koryo, which was formed after Goguryeo, Baekje and Silla?

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:53.640
Do you remember? Yes, this is Goryeo

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:05.150
Then... right now...

00:22:05.970 --> 00:22:07.740
who sits on the throne?

00:22:09.280 --> 00:22:13.980
His Majesty, who founded this land, of course

00:22:13.980 --> 00:22:16.850
His Majesty who founded Goryeo

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:18.440
Really...

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:20.170
Taejo Wang Gon?!

00:22:29.880 --> 00:22:33.350
Today we found a bird in the Crown Prince's breakfast

00:22:33.350 --> 00:22:36.250
This happened before I even started eating.

00:22:36.250 --> 00:22:38.190
It was great luck that the Crown Prince

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:40.120
I didn't eat because I wasn't hungry

00:22:40.220 --> 00:22:42.470
Taejo Wang Gon

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:44.250
Where is the culprit?

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:48.180
Catch the man who wanted to kill the Crown Prince

00:22:48.180 --> 00:22:50.710
We have to find out why this happened

00:22:50.470 --> 00:22:54.370
Wang Sik Ryom

00:22:50.710 --> 00:22:54.690
What will change after the criminal is caught?

00:22:56.190 --> 00:23:00.460
Minister Wang Sik Ryom, what are you trying to say?

00:23:00.460 --> 00:23:03.100
Does the crown prince behave like a crown prince?

00:23:03.100 --> 00:23:08.720
Crown Prince - 1st Prince Mu

00:23:04.380 --> 00:23:05.830
At the board meeting

00:23:05.830 --> 00:23:09.430
he greeted the foreign ambassadors and left

00:23:10.080 --> 00:23:14.740
He prefers hot springs to the battlefield

00:23:15.340 --> 00:23:17.920
You know there's a rumor going around

00:23:17.920 --> 00:23:20.500
like the crown prince has an incurable disease?

00:23:22.760 --> 00:23:26.410
Therefore, I, Wang Sik Ryeom, ask you

00:23:26.410 --> 00:23:31.240
Please remove Prince Wang Mu from his position as crown prince.

00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:34.800
I ask you to name the new crown prince

00:23:36.270 --> 00:23:38.210
Do you all agree with him?

00:23:40.300 --> 00:23:41.660
Speak

00:23:42.400 --> 00:23:44.680
Which one of you really wants to take a seat?

00:23:44.680 --> 00:23:46.050
the current crown prince?

00:23:56.920 --> 00:23:59.300
Please take back your words, Your Majesty

00:23:59.300 --> 00:24:02.420
None of us wants to take the place of the crown prince.

00:24:04.930 --> 00:24:06.400
It's true, Your Majesty

00:24:06.400 --> 00:24:08.470
Please take back your words

00:24:11.640 --> 00:24:14.360
Yes, please take them

00:24:18.190 --> 00:24:21.220
Please take back your words, Your Majesty

00:24:24.240 --> 00:24:25.760
Astronomer Choi Chi Mon

00:24:28.960 --> 00:24:30.610
Loyal Subject Choi Chi Mon

00:24:30.610 --> 00:24:33.790
will convey the will of heaven to everyone present

00:24:35.530 --> 00:24:40.550
Crown Prince Wang Mu's star is a royal star

00:24:40.550 --> 00:24:43.120
This is the first star of the five northern stars

00:24:43.120 --> 00:24:45.890
and she shines brighter every day

00:24:45.890 --> 00:24:51.070
She shines brighter next to the shining Goryeo Palace

00:24:51.070 --> 00:24:55.610
This means he has no shortcomings as a crown prince.

00:24:58.040 --> 00:25:00.940
I founded Koryo 24 years ago

00:25:01.560 --> 00:25:04.950
1st Prince Wang Mu fought alongside me in many battles

00:25:04.950 --> 00:25:06.730
He laid the foundation for this nation

00:25:08.110 --> 00:25:09.650
Choi Chi Mon

00:25:10.750 --> 00:25:12.420
During the ritual

00:25:12.420 --> 00:25:15.060
evil spirits will be driven out of Wang Mu

00:25:15.060 --> 00:25:16.890
Get everything ready

00:25:16.890 --> 00:25:18.440
Yes, Your Majesty!

00:25:22.570 --> 00:25:26.970
Empress Yu

00:25:25.350 --> 00:25:27.200
It's true

00:25:39.760 --> 00:25:42.800
The Crown Prince is lucky

00:25:43.680 --> 00:25:46.140
He will have a long life

00:25:46.140 --> 00:25:48.910
He just needs to be more careful and vigilant

00:25:48.910 --> 00:25:50.490
This is the maid

00:25:56.890 --> 00:25:59.300
Tell him I don't want to see anyone

00:25:59.300 --> 00:26:02.500
It's been 2 years since the 4th prince left

00:26:02.500 --> 00:26:04.370
If you could just see each other...

00:26:04.370 --> 00:26:06.320
I don't feel good

00:26:06.850 --> 00:26:09.370
Who dares to disturb the empress?

00:26:10.640 --> 00:26:14.670
4th Prince Wang So

00:26:21.030 --> 00:26:22.210
Mother?

00:26:23.450 --> 00:26:26.800
Empress Yu fell asleep, she is very sick

00:26:26.800 --> 00:26:29.910
You should come back at another time

00:27:03.290 --> 00:27:05.470
Then I died

00:27:05.470 --> 00:27:10.020
That Hae Soo girl must have drowned and died too

00:27:12.040 --> 00:27:16.290
So who am I? Go Ha Jin? Or Hae Soo?

00:27:19.900 --> 00:27:24.310
I don’t know how I ended up in Koryo and in this body.

00:27:25.510 --> 00:27:27.020
Think positively

00:27:27.020 --> 00:27:28.680
Now's your chance

00:27:28.680 --> 00:27:30.760
Chance to avoid death and survive

00:27:30.760 --> 00:27:33.060
You are very lucky

00:27:33.060 --> 00:27:36.570
So don't worry. You have to go through this

00:27:36.570 --> 00:27:37.690
If you can handle it

00:27:40.940 --> 00:27:42.420
If you can handle it...

00:27:45.560 --> 00:27:47.630
I'm not Hae Soo, I'll get caught

00:27:47.630 --> 00:27:49.040
What should I do?

00:27:50.140 --> 00:27:52.600
- Madam
- Su

00:27:52.600 --> 00:27:56.250
Come out and let's talk. Please come out

00:27:57.120 --> 00:28:00.410
Madam, please open

00:28:01.420 --> 00:28:03.350
What are you going to do?

00:28:03.350 --> 00:28:07.990
What is this? What's happening?

00:28:08.890 --> 00:28:10.180
I'm scared

00:28:10.930 --> 00:28:12.800
Scared to death

00:28:13.850 --> 00:28:16.450
I don't even know anything about Goryeo

00:28:18.340 --> 00:28:21.480
Emperor Taejo - founder of Goryeo

00:28:22.300 --> 00:28:24.310
After Taejo...

00:28:26.950 --> 00:28:28.720
After Taejo...

00:28:28.720 --> 00:28:30.590
What's wrong with you?

00:28:30.590 --> 00:28:32.190
Gwangjong?

00:28:35.290 --> 00:28:37.270
8th Prince Wang Wook

00:28:36.510 --> 00:28:37.700
wife

00:28:38.220 --> 00:28:39.410
wife

00:28:42.470 --> 00:28:43.530
What's going on?

00:28:43.530 --> 00:28:45.310
- Madam Su!
- Hae Soo?

00:28:45.710 --> 00:28:49.970
She fell into the water and did not come to her senses for 2 hours

00:28:49.970 --> 00:28:51.980
The doctor said,

00:28:52.550 --> 00:28:54.820
that she stopped breathing

00:28:54.820 --> 00:28:57.770
Are you saying that she died?

00:28:57.770 --> 00:28:59.210
She died and came back

00:28:59.210 --> 00:29:03.280
Maybe that's why she doesn't remember anything, not even her name.

00:29:06.350 --> 00:29:10.580
I'm afraid she might do something to herself

00:29:45.910 --> 00:29:48.730
Su, don't be afraid

00:29:50.550 --> 00:29:52.390
I brought you to this place

00:29:52.950 --> 00:29:55.740
And I will help you until the very end

00:30:00.960 --> 00:30:04.150
Did you bring me to this place?

00:30:04.840 --> 00:30:07.090
If you avoid it, nothing will change

00:30:10.070 --> 00:30:11.290
Need to be strong

00:30:23.400 --> 00:30:27.140
Why don't you trust me and come out?

00:30:36.280 --> 00:30:38.900
I can't go back

00:30:38.900 --> 00:30:41.660
And I can't change anything now

00:30:46.460 --> 00:30:47.910
I want to live!

00:30:48.430 --> 00:30:50.980
I'll do whatever it takes to survive

00:30:59.570 --> 00:31:01.110
I want to live!

00:31:31.770 --> 00:31:33.230
What does "wife" mean?!

00:31:33.890 --> 00:31:35.920
- Your Majesty!
- Move away

00:31:36.740 --> 00:31:38.670
Wang So Wang Moo

00:31:37.420 --> 00:31:39.230
Your Majesty!

00:31:39.750 --> 00:31:41.640
I'll commit suicide

00:31:42.620 --> 00:31:45.410
Our firstborn died

00:31:45.780 --> 00:31:47.160
Are you getting married?

00:31:47.160 --> 00:31:49.540
How can you get married at such a time?

00:31:49.540 --> 00:31:52.360
South Koryo is in danger

00:31:52.360 --> 00:31:56.220
Marriage will be the solution

00:31:56.220 --> 00:31:59.440
You are not only the ruler, but also the father of my children

00:31:59.440 --> 00:32:01.810
Aren't you upset?

00:32:01.810 --> 00:32:04.110
Does your heart hurt?

00:32:04.110 --> 00:32:07.130
Wouldn't you die if you could bring the child back like that?!

00:32:08.600 --> 00:32:10.490
People's lives are at stake

00:32:13.810 --> 00:32:15.120
Emperor

00:32:25.070 --> 00:32:27.330
If that's all you care about,

00:32:27.330 --> 00:32:29.960
Why then should we bother the living?

00:32:29.960 --> 00:32:32.010
Mother

00:32:39.420 --> 00:32:41.780
Choose: marriage or son?

00:32:41.780 --> 00:32:43.940
- Empress!
- Choose

00:32:43.940 --> 00:32:47.810
Koryo or your son's life?

00:32:47.810 --> 00:32:49.690
Put the knife down

00:32:49.690 --> 00:32:52.680
You won't change anything anyway!

00:32:55.130 --> 00:32:59.360
You are truly amazing, indeed.

00:33:01.630 --> 00:33:05.640
If I don't own your heart then I don't need anything

00:33:27.550 --> 00:33:29.220
So!

00:33:30.210 --> 00:33:31.510
So!

00:33:33.140 --> 00:33:34.750
Is there anyone outside?!

00:33:58.540 --> 00:34:01.820
They called me here to offer me to become the crown prince's man?

00:34:02.560 --> 00:34:05.390
I don't know if you will be a shield for him

00:34:05.390 --> 00:34:08.370
or a sword with which you will get rid of him

00:34:19.770 --> 00:34:24.670
Residence of the 8th Prince Wang Wook

00:34:39.310 --> 00:34:43.480
You liked throwing arrows, so you bet and played

00:34:43.480 --> 00:34:47.950
Oh, that tree over there we planted together with you

00:34:49.320 --> 00:34:51.710
Oh, you play very well with the shuttlecock

00:34:51.710 --> 00:34:56.120
So I love throwing arrows and playing with the shuttlecock

00:34:56.120 --> 00:35:01.810
I'm here keeping my cousin company and helping her

00:35:01.810 --> 00:35:03.010
- That's right
- Okay

00:35:03.010 --> 00:35:05.160
My name is Hae Soo

00:35:05.160 --> 00:35:09.500
And you are my personal maid - Chae Ryung

00:35:09.500 --> 00:35:10.580
Right?

00:35:14.650 --> 00:35:18.770
Now I think I'm starting to remember

00:35:18.770 --> 00:35:21.940
You're talking to me politely

00:35:21.940 --> 00:35:25.380
What's the matter with you, madam?

00:35:25.380 --> 00:35:27.130
God, exactly, exactly

00:35:30.580 --> 00:35:33.650
Chae Ryung, don't worry

00:35:34.070 --> 00:35:36.560
So? Do you remember?

00:35:36.560 --> 00:35:39.740
I think so. Or maybe not

00:35:39.740 --> 00:35:41.150
Just don't worry

00:35:41.150 --> 00:35:44.010
I'm one of those people who study one thing

00:35:44.010 --> 00:35:46.390
but they understand ten at once

00:35:47.410 --> 00:35:48.960
I'll try

00:35:51.290 --> 00:35:54.800
Is it true that you don't remember anything?

00:35:57.940 --> 00:36:01.300
Just between us.
Just tell me

00:36:01.300 --> 00:36:03.880
You're lying, right?

00:36:05.360 --> 00:36:08.000
The prince and his wife don't know

00:36:08.000 --> 00:36:12.250
but I was with you every day

00:36:13.690 --> 00:36:15.120
What is this?

00:36:15.740 --> 00:36:19.320
Are you having an affair with a man from another family?

00:36:19.320 --> 00:36:21.550
Or are you in debt?

00:36:28.050 --> 00:36:32.770
Is Hae Soo such a girl?

00:36:33.600 --> 00:36:36.850
So she pretends to be a good young lady,

00:36:36.850 --> 00:36:41.050
Does he meet with men at night?

00:36:41.050 --> 00:36:42.820
She's not that bad

00:36:44.400 --> 00:36:47.310
But why do you talk about yourself as another person?

00:36:48.210 --> 00:36:51.410
You must have hit yourself hard!

00:36:51.410 --> 00:36:53.440
Gotta keep your mouth shut

00:36:53.440 --> 00:36:56.460
Otherwise they'll think I'm a fraud if I say I'm not Hae Soo

00:36:56.460 --> 00:36:58.370
- Chae Ryung
- Yes?

00:37:02.340 --> 00:37:06.510
Sorry. There's another girl inside me

00:37:09.310 --> 00:37:11.390
Just forget it

00:37:11.390 --> 00:37:12.800
No need to die twice

00:37:12.800 --> 00:37:14.140
I was joking

00:37:21.380 --> 00:37:22.510
Chae Ryong!

00:37:23.770 --> 00:37:26.290
I don't have wrinkles near my mouth, right?

00:37:26.290 --> 00:37:27.760
What?

00:37:32.910 --> 00:37:36.550
The skin is so elastic!

00:37:36.550 --> 00:37:41.380
That's it! I haven't been in this state for a long time!

00:37:42.790 --> 00:37:44.430
oh my god

00:37:44.430 --> 00:37:48.600
She took good care of herself in Goryeo, even though they only eat vegetables here

00:37:49.290 --> 00:37:52.220
Madam!

00:37:52.220 --> 00:37:54.650
She was badly hurt!

00:37:55.970 --> 00:37:58.970
Being alive again isn't so bad

00:38:01.620 --> 00:38:05.090
Jeomseongdae Palace

00:38:19.010 --> 00:38:21.560
Wow! Look at this!

00:38:21.560 --> 00:38:23.150
What is it?

00:38:23.150 --> 00:38:24.310
What?

00:38:24.800 --> 00:38:26.490
Chi Mon! Chi Mon!

00:38:26.490 --> 00:38:27.840
Tenth Prince!

00:38:31.870 --> 00:38:33.690
This is a plane

00:38:34.270 --> 00:38:35.740
Airplane?

00:38:36.290 --> 00:38:37.600
What is this?

00:38:37.600 --> 00:38:41.100
This is an instrument that will soar in the sky like a bird.

00:38:41.100 --> 00:38:44.090
One day your children will have children

00:38:44.420 --> 00:38:47.320
Your children's children will have children too

00:38:47.320 --> 00:38:53.660
People will use it to fly to foreign lands

00:38:53.680 --> 00:38:55.510
Wow!

00:38:55.510 --> 00:38:58.040
Chi Mon invents amazing things

00:38:58.040 --> 00:39:01.540
You always look at the sky, but more often you say strange things

00:39:01.540 --> 00:39:03.980
What you said about the crown prince's star...

00:39:03.980 --> 00:39:05.600
is this true?

00:39:05.600 --> 00:39:07.910
That's what I wanted to say

00:39:07.910 --> 00:39:10.960
A person who knows the will of Heaven is a subject of the crown prince

00:39:10.960 --> 00:39:12.760
Everyone in Goryeo knows it

00:39:12.760 --> 00:39:16.190
I navigate by the sky in order to live.
Do you think I'm lying?

00:39:16.190 --> 00:39:19.360
Then Chi Mon, what about me?

00:39:19.360 --> 00:39:22.590
If you tell me about me, I agree that you were right before

00:39:30.370 --> 00:39:32.650
On the birthday of the 13th prince

00:39:32.650 --> 00:39:35.820
Mercury, Venus, Mars and Jupiter are aligned, right?

00:39:35.820 --> 00:39:38.350
In this situation, great people were born

00:39:38.350 --> 00:39:42.770
Besides, you will be lucky with women

00:39:42.770 --> 00:39:45.750
What? Are there no other men in the world?

00:39:46.890 --> 00:39:49.060
Even I can say that

00:39:49.060 --> 00:39:53.200
Who doesn't know that all the girls in Songak fall down when they see Baek Ah?

00:39:53.200 --> 00:39:56.820
If that's all, I'll say that our 3rd brother is good at managing

00:39:56.820 --> 00:39:59.100
- 9th brother is lucky in wealth
- That's right

00:39:59.100 --> 00:40:01.290
Our 8th brother is very smart

00:40:01.860 --> 00:40:04.320
And our 10th brother...

00:40:05.800 --> 00:40:07.500
10th brother, he...

00:40:07.500 --> 00:40:10.120
I have the blessing of a little brother

00:40:11.370 --> 00:40:13.300
Hey little one...

00:40:14.690 --> 00:40:17.780
You're breaking my heart

00:40:17.780 --> 00:40:21.120
You used to like my stories

00:40:21.120 --> 00:40:23.180
Now you don't believe me?

00:40:23.180 --> 00:40:24.740
We were children

00:40:24.740 --> 00:40:27.790
And now we have grown up and will not allow us to be misled

00:40:28.360 --> 00:40:31.000
Yes, you are adults now

00:40:31.000 --> 00:40:34.530
Words won't convince you

00:40:34.530 --> 00:40:36.310
Brother he said we've grown up

00:40:36.810 --> 00:40:38.220
I'm not done growing!

00:40:38.220 --> 00:40:40.320
It's okay, you're big elsewhere

00:40:43.090 --> 00:40:46.210
I'm talking about his heart and respect for others

00:40:49.260 --> 00:40:50.930
Yes, exactly!

00:40:56.770 --> 00:40:59.140
By the way, about the 4th brother...

00:40:59.140 --> 00:41:03.210
I heard he's in the palace.
Why didn’t you come to say hello then?

00:41:03.210 --> 00:41:07.120
Did you hear about how he killed the horse he was riding?

00:41:07.120 --> 00:41:10.160
They say warriors who saw this have nightmares

00:41:10.160 --> 00:41:12.150
And they all took time off

00:41:12.150 --> 00:41:14.110
Why did he do this?

00:41:14.110 --> 00:41:18.180
Because of the way he is, I would refuse to greet him

00:41:18.180 --> 00:41:20.140
He probably suffers more than anyone

00:41:20.970 --> 00:41:23.990
Don't be like that, he's your brother

00:41:38.660 --> 00:41:40.030
Long time no see

00:41:42.810 --> 00:41:43.910
Yes

00:41:54.550 --> 00:41:56.460
Brother!

00:41:56.460 --> 00:41:58.100
Are you okay?

00:41:58.100 --> 00:41:59.880
Am I the only one who almost suffocated?

00:41:59.880 --> 00:42:00.940
I don't know

00:42:18.230 --> 00:42:19.400
Chae Ryung

00:42:19.400 --> 00:42:24.000
What kind of person is this 8th prince?

00:42:24.000 --> 00:42:25.890
I can't remember

00:42:26.610 --> 00:42:29.260
He is the best man in all of Goryeo

00:42:29.260 --> 00:42:32.730
As educated as any scientist

00:42:32.730 --> 00:42:35.780
Of all the 25 princes, he has the best character

00:42:36.450 --> 00:42:43.320
Many believe that the Crown Prince should not be the 1st Prince, but ours

00:42:44.870 --> 00:42:47.660
Is this person Gwangjong?

00:42:57.230 --> 00:42:59.610
They seem to have a good relationship

00:42:59.610 --> 00:43:01.250
Of course

00:43:01.250 --> 00:43:04.490
He is very caring and attentive to his sick wife

00:43:04.490 --> 00:43:07.630
She trusts him, will follow him anywhere

00:43:07.630 --> 00:43:09.940
Everyone envy them

00:43:45.390 --> 00:43:50.080
I think I felt like I could trust him too

00:44:13.810 --> 00:44:15.180
Disrespectful

00:44:28.190 --> 00:44:30.700
We just wanted to greet you, princess

00:44:32.410 --> 00:44:33.650
Mistress

00:44:33.650 --> 00:44:37.510
You must greet Princess Yeon Hwa

00:44:38.740 --> 00:44:40.810
Is she a princess?

00:44:41.720 --> 00:44:45.970
Of course there are princes, there must be a princess

00:44:45.970 --> 00:44:50.320
Leave her alone. I heard that she lost her memory

00:44:50.320 --> 00:44:53.710
But, apparently, she has also lost her manners, what should I do?

00:44:53.710 --> 00:44:58.540
I think it wouldn't hurt to learn them again

00:45:02.710 --> 00:45:05.330
She loves to humiliate people on the sly

00:45:05.330 --> 00:45:08.310
No need to look at what the married couple is doing

00:45:08.310 --> 00:45:11.390
I'll deal with you closely if this happens again.

00:45:11.390 --> 00:45:13.610
And it doesn't matter that you and her are cousins

00:45:14.830 --> 00:45:16.290
Do you understand?

00:45:20.650 --> 00:45:23.360
Crooked eyes and mouth

00:45:23.360 --> 00:45:26.390
Look how your hand strains

00:45:26.390 --> 00:45:30.520
I've been through a lot before, but this...

00:45:30.520 --> 00:45:32.880
If you don't like me, say so

00:45:35.190 --> 00:45:37.790
- What?
- I realized this while looking at you

00:45:37.790 --> 00:45:41.660
Trying to find a reason to put me in my place

00:45:42.710 --> 00:45:46.510
It won't work with me, I've been through a lot

00:45:46.510 --> 00:45:49.350
What did this girl tell me?

00:45:49.350 --> 00:45:51.350
Forgive her, princess!

00:45:52.560 --> 00:45:55.680
The lady is not yet in her right mind

00:45:55.680 --> 00:45:56.930
Called me crazy?

00:45:56.930 --> 00:45:59.160
No, that's not true!

00:45:59.160 --> 00:46:01.860
Girl! How do you behave in this house?

00:46:01.860 --> 00:46:03.150
Girl?!

00:46:04.570 --> 00:46:06.060
What's all the fuss?

00:46:08.580 --> 00:46:09.930
Brother

00:46:35.590 --> 00:46:39.280
It seems you've forgotten how to greet someone due to your injury.

00:46:39.280 --> 00:46:41.360
Hello...

00:46:42.500 --> 00:46:46.550
Hello... those...

00:46:48.500 --> 00:46:50.570
They say you don't remember anything

00:46:51.200 --> 00:46:53.400
So you don't remember me either

00:46:53.400 --> 00:46:56.100
I heard that you are the 8th prince

00:46:57.230 --> 00:46:58.620
Did you hear?

00:47:01.760 --> 00:47:05.840
So did you spy on the princes in the bath before or after you lost your memory?

00:47:06.570 --> 00:47:10.390
This... I don't remember this

00:47:15.070 --> 00:47:18.900
Okay. Then what are you planning to do now?

00:47:18.900 --> 00:47:21.900
I'll let you do whatever you want

00:47:22.460 --> 00:47:23.500
What?

00:47:25.220 --> 00:47:29.510
When my wife brought you, I wanted to watch you

00:47:29.510 --> 00:47:32.460
You can get treatment, you can return to your hometown

00:47:33.210 --> 00:47:35.850
You don't remember anything, life here will seem difficult

00:47:35.850 --> 00:47:38.260
- I'll help you find a small house
- Why?

00:47:44.840 --> 00:47:46.310
In terms of?

00:47:46.310 --> 00:47:50.770
These are my problems, why are you worried?

00:47:52.620 --> 00:47:55.710
Oh... because I'm your wife's cousin

00:47:56.950 --> 00:47:58.830
But still...

00:47:59.700 --> 00:48:02.790
I don't like accepting handouts from other people

00:48:03.810 --> 00:48:06.010
I can handle it myself

00:48:08.270 --> 00:48:10.640
For... handouts?

00:48:12.190 --> 00:48:15.390
I didn't quite understand you

00:48:15.390 --> 00:48:17.250
What kind of term is this?

00:48:19.680 --> 00:48:20.870
at all?

00:48:22.230 --> 00:48:26.560
In general, I can handle everything and stay in this house

00:48:31.690 --> 00:48:35.070
I don't remember anything, so I can't go anywhere

00:48:35.070 --> 00:48:38.110
Your wife, Chae Ryung and you

00:48:38.110 --> 00:48:43.000
You are all very kind, I think I can get through this...

00:48:43.000 --> 00:48:45.950
There's nothing I can't do!

00:48:45.950 --> 00:48:47.450
I'm very smart!

00:48:47.450 --> 00:48:50.230
And I'm learning quickly...

00:48:50.230 --> 00:48:52.090
You'll see

00:48:52.510 --> 00:48:55.550
I will become useful in your home

00:48:56.850 --> 00:48:58.460
I'll try to learn everything

00:48:58.460 --> 00:49:01.960
so as not to be a burden for you

00:49:12.540 --> 00:49:13.750
You

00:49:15.520 --> 00:49:17.140
looks like another person

00:49:22.240 --> 00:49:24.470
We were never close

00:49:24.470 --> 00:49:26.700
but the way you talk and act

00:49:27.760 --> 00:49:29.330
doesn't look like you

00:49:36.580 --> 00:49:38.330
It doesn't matter to me

00:49:38.330 --> 00:49:39.650
What?

00:49:41.170 --> 00:49:43.730
I won't push your memories anymore

00:49:43.730 --> 00:49:45.290
and ask if you followed the princes

00:49:45.880 --> 00:49:48.360
You shouldn't bother my wife

00:49:50.850 --> 00:49:52.020
Okay?

00:49:53.210 --> 00:49:55.750
Yes, Prince

00:49:59.110 --> 00:50:00.280
You can go

00:50:00.280 --> 00:50:02.720
Now I will work!

00:50:13.310 --> 00:50:14.640
“Will I get through this”?

00:50:42.300 --> 00:50:44.320
This is the last book

00:50:44.320 --> 00:50:46.020
Do you want to take it?

00:50:49.960 --> 00:50:51.610
Why did they want to see me?

00:50:55.500 --> 00:50:57.630
The servant who brought breakfast to the crown prince

00:50:57.630 --> 00:50:59.550
was found hanging in a noose

00:51:01.530 --> 00:51:04.390
It's murder made out to be suicide

00:51:04.390 --> 00:51:06.860
Don't you think there's a criminal in the palace?

00:51:06.860 --> 00:51:10.190
Perhaps one of the princes

00:51:11.780 --> 00:51:13.670
Find the culprit

00:51:15.930 --> 00:51:18.840
Find the culprit? What am I, a dog?

00:51:20.290 --> 00:51:23.900
People call me Wolf, now you think I'm a dog

00:51:24.620 --> 00:51:27.340
Having fun killing a horse?

00:51:28.810 --> 00:51:31.470
Do you want to stop living as a hostage and move to Songak?

00:51:34.370 --> 00:51:37.050
This is your chance, prince

00:51:37.050 --> 00:51:39.080
Take advantage of it

00:51:39.080 --> 00:51:40.320
Look at me

00:51:40.320 --> 00:51:43.220
I said that the emperor will realize his dream by unifying the three Han states

00:51:43.220 --> 00:51:45.230
Now do you see where I am?

00:51:45.230 --> 00:51:47.910
These tricks won't work on me

00:51:48.700 --> 00:51:52.230
I'm not the little boy who fell for them

00:51:54.740 --> 00:51:57.260
Don't you dare play with me

00:51:59.360 --> 00:52:01.720
This is the will of the Crown Prince

00:52:14.560 --> 00:52:19.110
We were given a tip that the crown prince would be killed during the ritual.

00:52:23.850 --> 00:52:25.840
Should I pretend to be my brother?

00:52:28.130 --> 00:52:30.300
Then what will you promise in return?

00:52:30.300 --> 00:52:32.390
How about catching the criminal?

00:52:32.390 --> 00:52:35.760
Then I'll do whatever you want

00:52:43.810 --> 00:52:47.060
I will live in Songak

00:53:06.240 --> 00:53:09.790
Thanks to you, we had the most beautiful lanterns in our house.

00:53:09.790 --> 00:53:11.600
This year will be difficult

00:53:11.600 --> 00:53:14.110
Probably because the wound hasn't healed

00:53:14.800 --> 00:53:16.920
Hands don't obey at all

00:53:16.920 --> 00:53:19.920
What can I do? You didn't do it on purpose

00:53:20.780 --> 00:53:23.090
You need to rest, go

00:53:26.830 --> 00:53:29.900
No, I shouldn't rest alone

00:53:29.900 --> 00:53:32.430
I'll do whatever you need, just tell me

00:53:32.430 --> 00:53:34.380
How nice of you

00:53:35.360 --> 00:53:37.760
Then, Chae Ryung,

00:53:37.760 --> 00:53:40.690
show your mistress where you mix the glue

00:53:40.690 --> 00:53:43.200
Can you help with this?

00:53:43.200 --> 00:53:46.120
Of course it's not a big deal

00:53:49.900 --> 00:53:55.210
I'm standing in front of you again, standing here alone

00:53:55.210 --> 00:53:58.380
Tell me with your lips

00:53:55.530 --> 00:53:58.140
Princess Yong Hwa, or whatever her name is...

00:53:58.380 --> 00:54:00.920
Only "yes", only "yes"

00:53:58.930 --> 00:54:00.930
Acted like she was thinking about me

00:54:00.920 --> 00:54:05.490
I don’t understand why, but I always rush to you

00:54:00.930 --> 00:54:02.350
Goat

00:54:03.250 --> 00:54:07.050
Damn, how long do I have to stand here?

00:54:05.490 --> 00:54:10.790
With a breath of wind I will tell you: I love

00:54:10.260 --> 00:54:13.170
I know how to take care of my skin

00:54:13.170 --> 00:54:18.050
massage and apply makeup.
I can drive a truck

00:54:19.240 --> 00:54:20.960
Just look at me

00:54:23.050 --> 00:54:25.080
Looks like dog food

00:54:31.450 --> 00:54:33.650
But even in difficult times for me

00:54:33.650 --> 00:54:36.760
All my thoughts were only about you

00:54:36.760 --> 00:54:38.780
Now I was able to understand everything,

00:54:38.780 --> 00:54:41.820
Others will leave, maybe only you are with me

00:54:41.820 --> 00:54:43.780
Well, last spring we suddenly met

00:54:43.780 --> 00:54:46.450
I hope there will be no such coincidences in the future.

00:54:46.450 --> 00:54:48.750
I want to hold your hand so tightly

00:54:48.750 --> 00:54:50.660
And I will follow you anywhere

00:54:50.660 --> 00:54:55.830
I'm standing in front of you again, standing here alone

00:54:51.950 --> 00:54:55.980
Damn! What to do! I knew it would happen like this!

00:54:55.830 --> 00:54:59.030
Tell me with your lips

00:54:59.030 --> 00:55:01.670
Only "yes", only "yes"

00:55:01.670 --> 00:55:06.200
I don’t understand why, but I always rush to you

00:55:03.960 --> 00:55:08.590
Princess Yong Hwa tasked me with making glue

00:55:06.200 --> 00:55:12.300
With a breath of wind I will tell you: I love

00:55:11.750 --> 00:55:16.620
You said you'd study everything and get through everything

00:55:15.480 --> 00:55:17.480
Need you!

00:55:16.620 --> 00:55:20.610
Looks like you're doing well

00:55:20.050 --> 00:55:23.650
My dear, so to speak I want

00:55:21.850 --> 00:55:26.130
You're an amazing person, though.

00:55:23.650 --> 00:55:26.090
What I can’t say

00:55:26.790 --> 00:55:32.180
My dear, my dear, my dear: I love you!

00:55:55.740 --> 00:55:56.940
Eh, brother

00:55:58.540 --> 00:56:00.240
I can't do it anymore!

00:56:00.240 --> 00:56:02.740
We've already done this a hundred times, how many more do we need?

00:56:02.740 --> 00:56:04.840
I'm like a dog wagging its tail

00:56:04.840 --> 00:56:07.340
And despite this, you are still wrong!

00:56:07.340 --> 00:56:09.040
Because of you I have to repeat it!

00:56:09.040 --> 00:56:10.600
Not just because of me

00:56:10.600 --> 00:56:11.570
Him too!

00:56:11.570 --> 00:56:14.800
Pretends he wasn't wrong, fools everyone

00:56:14.800 --> 00:56:17.000
Undetected error

00:56:17.000 --> 00:56:18.800
can't be considered a mistake, brother

00:56:19.400 --> 00:56:20.000
Oh you...

00:56:20.000 --> 00:56:22.150
Okay, you must be tired

00:56:22.150 --> 00:56:23.450
Let's take a break

00:56:26.060 --> 00:56:28.270
Where's So? When will he come?

00:56:28.270 --> 00:56:30.020
This is his first time, so he needs to practice

00:56:30.020 --> 00:56:32.590
Yes, the 4th prince will arrive soon

00:56:33.110 --> 00:56:36.190
I heard that when the ritual is over,

00:56:36.190 --> 00:56:40.210
the emperor will hand over the throne to the crown prince

00:56:42.790 --> 00:56:43.920
What?

00:56:44.490 --> 00:56:47.460
Are there really such rumors?

00:56:47.460 --> 00:56:50.500
Wow! I've never heard this before

00:56:50.860 --> 00:56:55.800
Even if it's true, the emperor won't tell me that.

00:56:55.800 --> 00:56:57.490
I'm just an astronomer

00:56:57.930 --> 00:57:00.710
I have to go to the crown prince and talk about the ritual

00:57:00.710 --> 00:57:03.270
Why don't you continue your training?

00:57:09.560 --> 00:57:13.060
It shouldn't have been like that.
What if the emperor finds out?

00:57:15.580 --> 00:57:17.430
Very thoughtless

00:57:17.430 --> 00:57:20.890
He wasn't the only one who was interested, don't blame him

00:57:21.700 --> 00:57:25.370
Choi Chi Mon didn't say it wasn't true

00:58:45.670 --> 00:58:48.030
Wolf! It's the Wolf!

00:58:55.040 --> 00:58:56.630
Wolf!

00:59:30.120 --> 00:59:40.520
I only remember your smell and your laughter

00:59:40.520 --> 00:59:46.970
I'm always waiting only for you, counting the days

00:59:46.970 --> 00:59:52.170
And it doesn’t matter where I am now, because only you are in my thoughts

00:59:52.770 --> 00:59:58.570
What I dreamed about and what I wanted

00:59:58.570 --> 01:00:02.830
I'm only waiting for you!

00:59:59.090 --> 01:00:06.000
Thanks for watching with us!
Release group MANIA

00:59:59.090 --> 01:00:06.000
http://doramamania.mybb.ru
http://vk.com/doramamania

01:00:06.000 --> 01:00:08.780
Scarlet Hearts: Ryeo

01:00:08.830 --> 01:00:12.560
You must avoid the 4th Prince if you see him!

01:00:12.560 --> 01:00:13.990
Did you see?!

01:00:13.990 --> 01:00:16.400
Wasn't it you who was in our bathhouse?

01:00:16.400 --> 01:00:17.420
Not me!

01:00:17.420 --> 01:00:20.070
You hit the prince, the emperor's son

01:00:19.870 --> 01:00:26.470
Another place and another time here, but I believe, you are my love

01:00:21.050 --> 01:00:22.400
Another prince?

01:00:22.400 --> 01:00:24.680
You can't escape punishment

01:00:25.090 --> 01:00:27.790
There won't be another chance

01:00:26.470 --> 01:00:32.370
A fair wind will bring your scent, it’s so easy for me to recognize it

01:00:28.120 --> 01:00:30.400
You must kill him

01:00:30.400 --> 01:00:32.510
Protect the Emperor!

01:00:32.510 --> 01:00:33.740
Follow him!

01:00:32.570 --> 01:00:35.170
But I don't understand

01:00:33.740 --> 01:00:37.620
I knew that I would be attacked, it was an important enemy

01:00:35.170 --> 01:00:39.070
When did you settle in my heart, tell me

01:00:39.070 --> 01:00:41.770
I don't understand

01:00:41.190 --> 01:00:42.550
Make a decision

01:00:41.770 --> 01:00:44.570
Why is my heart beating fast?

01:00:42.550 --> 01:00:44.610
Have mercy!

01:00:44.720 --> 01:00:46.270
You might suddenly pass by...

01:01:33.830 --> 01:01:35.890
Have mercy!
